### Health check
GET http://localhost:8000/

### List all documents
GET http://localhost:8000/api/documents

### List with search / limit
GET http://localhost:8000/api/documents?q=policy

###
GET http://localhost:8000/api/documents?limit=5

### Get one document
GET http://localhost:8000/api/documents/1

### Get one — not found
GET http://localhost:8000/api/documents/999

### Update metadata
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/documents/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approval_status": "Approved",
  "category": "HR Policy"
}

### Delete a document
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/documents/2


